full-query: "The operation team in the company has recently initiated an audit to ensure that all major AWS components used are properly monitored with necessary logs, alarms and notifications. The company has also set up an on-call team to receive AWS alerts and notifications and react accordingly when necessary. The AWS service of CodePipeline has been used as well by the development team for the new feature development. Relevant CodePipeline activities should be monitored such as the time and date of actions, the source IP address for an action, etc. What should the operation team do to ensure that CodePipeline is being properly monitored with enough logging? Select 2."
